<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <%- include('components/head') %>
  <title>Dash_____Board</title>
</head>

<body>
  <%- include('components/header') %>
  <main>
    <h3>Hello username, WElcome to your Dash_____Board!!</h3>
    <ul>
      <% posts.forEach(element => {%>
        <li>
          <a href="/post/<%= element.id %>"><%= element.title %></a> on <%= element.createDate %>
        </li>
      <% }); %>
    </ul>
    <p>The heart of the wise makes his speech judicious and adds persuasiveness to his lips. - Proverbs 16:23</p>
    <blockquote>I love the Lord, for he heard my voice; he heard my cry for mercy. Because he turned his ear to me, I will call on him as long as I live. - Psalm 116:1-2</blockquote>
  </main>
  <%- include('components/footer') %>
</body>

</html>
